ice Chief Calder Hebert says that the simple act of resisting arrest falls under this law, so is a hate crime. (https://reason.com/blog/2017/01/23/louisiana-police-chief-resisting-arrest)&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;I assume that, like me, you think the entire concept of a &amp;quot;hate crime&amp;quot; is ridiculous, but beyond all that, I&amp;#39;d like to hear your insight on this new turn in government overreach.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/9056184902368046637/comments/default/7420539411705150462'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/9056184902368046637/comments/default/7420539411705150462'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2017/01/the-slow-motion-state-murder-of-michael.html?showComment=1485261706441#c7420539411705150462' title=''/><author><name>All Wrong</name><uri>http://www.blogger.com/profile/01313858228631416622</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/b16-rounded.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2017/01/the-slow-motion-state-murder-of-michael.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-9056184902368046637' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/9056184902368046637' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-930702987"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="January 24, 2017 at 5:41 AM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-3328432236747833797</id><published>2017-01-22T08:58:52.314-07:00</published><updated>2017-01-22T08:58:52.314-07:00</updated><title type='text'>All Wrong, the podcast is being hosted at the Libe...</title><content type='html'>All Wrong, the podcast is being hosted at the Lib